    'Gulomov Ustoz' => 'Teacher Gulomov',
    'Sertifikat ID: LU-' => 'Certificate ID: LU-',
    'SAMARALI O‘RGANISH QO‘LLANMASI' => 'HOW TO LEARN EFFECTIVELY',
    'O‘zbek tilini tez va zavq bilan o‘rganish' => 'Learning Uzbek fast — and with joy',
    'Gulomov’s Academy metodikasi asosida tayyorlandi' => 'Based on the Gulomov’s Academy method',
    'Kattalar va sayyohlar uchun 5 maslahat' => '5 tips for adults and travellers',
    'Kuniga 5 daqiqa, lekin har kuni' => '5 minutes a day — every day',
    'Bir soatlik dars haftada bir marta emas — har kuni bitta qisqa dars. Ketma-ket kunlar «olovi» sizni ushlab turadi.' => 'Not one hour a week — one short lesson every day. Your daily streak keeps you going.',
    'Baland ovozda takrorlang' => 'Repeat out loud',
    'O‘qish bo‘limidagi har gapni bosing, tinglang va ovoz chiqarib qaytaring. Talaffuz faqat og‘izda shakllanadi.' => 'Tap every reading sentence, listen and say it aloud. Pronunciation is built by speaking.',
    'Sayohatdan oldin «Sayohatchilar uchun» kursi' => 'Take “Uzbek for travellers” before your trip',
    'Bozor, taksi, choyxona va mehmonxona iboralarini 6 ta darsda o‘rganib oling — O‘zbekistonda darhol ishlatasiz.' => 'Learn bazaar, taxi, teahouse and hotel phrases in 6 lessons — and use them the moment you land.',
    'Xatodan qo‘rqmang' => 'Don’t fear mistakes',
    'Tezkor mashq baholanmaydi — bemalol xato qiling. O‘zbeklar chet elliklarning bir og‘iz o‘zbekchasidan ham juda xursand bo‘ladi!' => 'Quick practice isn’t graded — make all the mistakes you want. Uzbeks are delighted by even a few words of Uzbek from a visitor!',
    'Madaniyat bilan birga' => 'Learn with the culture',
    '«Bilasizmi?» kartalari va «Ikki madaniyat ko‘prigi» kursi so‘zlarning ortidagi hayotni ko‘rsatadi — shunda ular esda qoladi.' => 'The “Did you know?” cards and the “Bridge of two cultures” course show the life behind the words — that’s what makes them stick.',
    'Xorijdagi ota-onalar uchun 5 oltin qoida' => '5 golden rules for parents abroad',
    '1. «Bitta ota-ona — bitta til» tamoyili (One Parent, One Language)' => '1. One parent, one language',
    'Uyda doimiy ravishda o‘zbek tilida gapiring. Bola inglizcha javob qaytarsa ham, siz o‘zbekcha so‘rashda va qo‘llab-quvvatlashda davom eting. Uning xatosini kulgiga olmang, to‘g‘ri variantini mehr bilan takrorlang.' => 'Speak Uzbek at home consistently. Even if your child answers in English, keep asking and encouraging in Uzbek. Never laugh at mistakes — gently repeat the right version.',
    '2. Kuniga 10–15 daqiqa muntazamlik — haftada bir marta 2 soatdan yaxshiroq' => '2. 10–15 minutes daily beats 2 hours once a week',
    'Bolaning miyasi qisqa va takrorlanuvchi tajribalarni oson o‘zlashtiradi. LingoUz mikro-darslarini har kuni 5 daqiqadan ko‘rib chiqish uzoq muddatda ajoyib natija beradi.' => 'Children absorb short, repeated experiences easily. Five minutes of LingoUz micro-lessons every day brings great long-term results.',
    '3. O‘zbekona ertaklar va multfilmlar' => '3. Uzbek fairy tales and cartoons',
    'Uyqudan oldin o‘zbek xalq ertaklarini birgalikda o‘qing yoki LingoUz audio lug‘atidagi yangi so‘zlarni kundalik buyumlarga bog‘lang (masalan, muzlatgichdagi olma, anor, sabzini birga sanash).' => 'Read Uzbek folk tales together at bedtime, or link new words from the LingoUz audio vocabulary to everyday things (count the apples, pomegranates and carrots in the fridge together).',
    '4. Bobo va buvilar bilan muntazam video-qo‘ng‘iroqlar' => '4. Regular video calls with grandparents',
    'O‘zbekistondagi yaqinlar bilan haftalik suhbatlar bolada tilga bo‘lgan tabiiy ehtiyojni va faxr tuyg‘usini uyg‘otadi. LingoUzda o‘rgangan yangi so‘zlarini buvasiga aytib berish bola uchun eng katta faxr!' => 'Weekly chats with family in Uzbekistan create a real need for the language — and pride. Telling grandpa a new word learned on LingoUz is a child’s proudest moment!',
    '5. LingoUz Zoom Live Speaking Room’da faol ishtirok' => '5. Join the LingoUz live Zoom sessions',
    'Boshqa shahar va davlatlardagi tengdoshlari ham o‘zbekcha gapirayotganini ko‘rish bolaga kuchli motivatsiya beradi: «Men yolg‘iz emasman, bu til juda qiziq ekan!»' => 'Seeing peers in other cities and countries speaking Uzbek is a huge motivator: “I’m not alone — this language is fun!”',
