    '1. Umumiy qoidalar' => '1. General',
    'LingoUz by Gulomov’s Academy — o‘zbek tilini o‘rganmoqchi bo‘lgan hamma uchun platforma: bolalar, kattalar va sayyohlar. Biz foydalanuvchilar, ayniqsa bolalarning onlayn xavfsizligini birinchi o‘ringa qo‘yamiz va AQShning <strong>COPPA (Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act)</strong> talablariga rioya qilamiz.' => 'LingoUz by Gulomov’s Academy is a platform for everyone who wants to learn Uzbek — kids, adults and travellers. Online safety, especially for children, comes first: we follow the US <strong>COPPA (Children’s Online Privacy Protection Act)</strong>.',
    '2. Biz qanday ma’lumotlarni yig‘amiz?' => '2. What data do we collect?',
    '<strong>Hisob uchun:</strong> ism yoki taxallus, email, yosh toifasi (aniq tug‘ilgan sana so‘ralmaydi), vaqt zonasi va dars natijalari.' => '<strong>For your account:</strong> name or nickname, email, age group (never a date of birth), time zone and lesson results.',
