    '<strong>Nimalarni yig‘maymiz:</strong> to‘liq familiya, yashash manzili, maktab yoki bolaning shaxsiy telefon raqami talab qilinmaydi.' => '<strong>What we never collect:</strong> full surname, home address, school or a child’s phone number.',
    '3. Bolalar va ota-onalar roziligi' => '3. Children and parental consent',
    '13 yoshgacha bo‘lgan bolaning profili faqat ota-onasi yoki qonuniy vasiysi roziligi bilan ochiladi. Ota-ona istalgan vaqtda profilni ko‘rishi, tahrirlashi yoki to‘liq o‘chirishni so‘rashi mumkin.' => 'Accounts for children under 13 are created only with a parent’s or legal guardian’s consent. Parents can view, edit or request full deletion of the account at any time.',
